# Async and Concurrency

- Prefer `async/await` over completion handlers; use `Task { }` at the boundary when crossing from sync to async.
- Annotate UI and view-model types with `@MainActor` where they touch UI or main-thread state.
- Avoid capturing mutable state in escaping closures; prefer `[weak self]` and explicit capture lists when needed.
- Mark types that cross actor boundaries as `Sendable` only when they are safe to share; otherwise keep them on a single actor or pass copies.
